    "name": "North Pacific and Arctic Ocean sediment core geochemical and grain size data",
    "description": "Geochemical and grain size measurements from sediment cores collected in the North Pacific and Arctic Ocean regions. The dataset contains 140 records across 10 sampling events (NPAL04, NPAL05, NPAL07, NPAL08, NPAL12, NPAL14, NPAL15, NPAL17, NPAL19, AeN_Q1_P1_BC1). Measurements include total organic carbon (TOC), total inorganic carbon (TIC), total nitrogen (TN), stable isotope ratios (δ13C, δ15N), grain size fractions (>63 µm, 63-2 µm, <2 µm), sedimentation rate, accumulation rate, sediment depth, and elevation. Data were collected between September 2018 and March 2021.",
